        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Luke's gimmick is his HANDGUN Bullets\nHandgun Bullets are COMMON cards\nThey have really low base damage, so additive buffs are amazing\nReally good for stacking Demon Dance or for activating Selena Coord Attacks"
          }
